{"articleNo":"251826","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=251826&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학원] [학적] 2021 GKS Admission Call for Graduate School Studying at KIT, Korea","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.02.25","hit":"8876","attachments":[{"name":"1. 2021 GKS-G 추천기관 선발업무지침.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=251826&attachNo=96616"},{"name":"2. 2021 GKS-G Application Guidelines (Korean).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=251826&attachNo=96617"},{"name":"3. 2021 GKS-G Application Guidelines (English).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=251826&attachNo=96618"},{"name":"4. 2021 GKS-G Application Forms.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=251826&attachNo=96619"},{"name":"5. 2021 GKS-G Application FAQs (ENGLISH-KOREAN).docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=251826&attachNo=96620"},{"name":"6. 2021 GKS-G 국가별 인원 배정표.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=251826&attachNo=96621"},{"name":"★2021 Available Fields of Study(Eng, Kor)_KIT.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=251826&attachNo=96622"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2021 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">GKS Admission Call</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> for Graduate School Studying at KIT, Korea</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">We are pleased to inform you of 2021&nbsp;GKS (Global Korea Scholarship) Guideline for Master’s and Doctoral candidates here in Korea.&nbsp;</span><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">As the one and only national engineering specialized university in Korea, we will be able to nominate candidates up to 35. This might be a great opportunity for you to be able to study in Korea with a full government scholarship.&nbsp;</span><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Please see attached for further information and if there are any candidates interested in this program, please send me </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">one original application document package no later than April </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">9th (Friday)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">, 2021</span></b></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">. Your original application documents must be delivered to my office by the deadline.</span></span></p><p><br></p><div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1. Applicants' GPA must be more than 2.64 on a 4.0 scale, 2.80 on a 4.3 scale, 2.91 on a 4.5 scale, 3.23 on a 5.0 scale, or score percentile of 80% from your university (Exception: A former or current KGSP scholar must hold the grade of 90% or above)</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2.&nbsp;</span><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Applicants who submit applications to more than two designated institutions will be disqualified.</span></font><br></div><div><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3.&nbsp;Scholarship duration: Master's(1 yr. of Korean Language + 2 yrs. of Master'), Doctoral(1 yr. of Korean Language + 3 yrs. of Doctoral)</span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">*In the case that scholar could not be able to complete one’s degree within scholarship duration, scholar should take care of one’s living expenses by oneself.</span><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17.3333px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17.3333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Applicants must be under 40 years of age as of Sep.1st, 2021</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">(born after Sep. 1, 1981).</span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17.3333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17.3333px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">5. I</span></span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 17.3333px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">n case of submitting photocopied documents, applicants MUST have the copies notarized or apostilled and then submit the notarized or apostilled copies.</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 17.3333px;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 17.3333px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">All required documents must be written by computer typing and send us one original document by post only (no e-mail application will be accepted). We don’t have online application for this GKS admission.</span><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 17.3333px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">For further information, please see attached, visit website (http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr) or contact GKS coordinator, Minkyeong Kwon.</span></font></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 17.3333px;\"><br></span></font></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 17.3333px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Submission Deadline:&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">April&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">9th (Friday)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">, 2021</span></span></b><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></b></div><div style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><font color=\"#ff0000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Submission address:</span></b></font></div><div style=\"\"><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">61 Daehak-ro, Gumi, Gyeongbuk, Korea,</span></b><br></div><div style=\"\"><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Kumoh National Institute of Technology</span></b><br></div><div style=\"\"><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">International Programs and Language Education Center</span></b><br></div><div style=\"\"><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">International Education Building, 1st floor, E103 (Postal Code 39177)</span></b><br></div><div style=\"\"><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></b></div><div style=\"\"><div><font color=\"#ff0000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Contact Person:</span></b></font></div><div><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Minkyeong Kwon</span></b></div><div><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">[Office] +82-54-478-7223</span></b></div><div><b style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">[Email] mkkwon@kumoh.ac.kr</span></b></div></div></div></font></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
